CHANGES MADE TO THE ORIGINAL WORK
---------------------------------

Per Section 4(b) of the License, the following files carry modifications made by
this fork. This list is the authoritative record of what was changed; see
README-FORK.md for the rationale behind each change.

Modified from the original Buzz source:

  crates/buzz-acp/src/pool.rs
      Added fetch_channel_roster(); added a roster parameter to
      fetch_prompt_profile_lookup(); wired both into the prompt call site.

  crates/buzz-acp/src/queue.rs
      Added format_channel_peers() and the [Channel Peers] prompt section;
      added roster and self_pubkey fields to FormatPromptArgs; added one test.

  crates/buzz-acp/src/base_prompt.md
      Added a "Chat Style" section to the agent base prompt. (This file is fed
      verbatim to language models as prompt text, so the modification notice is
      recorded here rather than inline, to avoid altering model behavior.)

  README.md
      Replaced with documentation for this fork. Attribution to Block, Inc.,
      the upstream project link, and the license terms are preserved in the
      replacement. The original is retrievable at any time via:
          git show upstream/main:README.md

